      text: 'Find sellers, register contact details and follow up agreement acceptance.\nStart with the seller\nSearch for the seller before registering a new person. Open the profile for contact details, items and agreements. If the store uses self-registration, review incoming applications in the registrations view before approving them. For store email, choose recipients and check the selection and displayed consent before sending.\nAgreements and acceptance\nAn owner or administrator can publish a new agreement version. Sellers can accept it in the seller portal. Staff can instead record a reference to acceptance already obtained elsewhere, such as a signed paper.\nSelect the correct agreement version when following up missing acceptance. If the store requires an agreement, acceptance is needed before receiving the drop-off.\nPrinting an agreement does not accept it. New versions do not change earlier acceptance evidence or receipts.',
